{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：20:43 2026-11-27 HKT</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/31489e81202ab71707504f40ce930011/2026-11/006_0_8.png\"/>\n<p>一艘往來上環與蛇口的客輪今日（27日）早上於青衣路對開海域發生撞船意外，導致22人受傷。海事處回覆《星島頭條》表示十分關注今次事故，已派驗船人員登船展開調查，並檢查船隻的結構安全。該艘渡輪須確定符合安全航行才會獲發出港證離開香港水域。</p>\n<img alt=\"有傷者手臂包紮著繃帶。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c5483a4fe2c01b26ff9213216afbb4c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_58_44_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"船上大批救援人員。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/92fd61367ac011e36879903ea5b4323f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_58_45_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d1a3cfda4d228422093d8b353b22e887/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_58_45.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3cc6a8e80fc3a6054c3c45ff33f4f546/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_58_43.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有傷者可自行登上救護車。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/07b64570b7387a8e4e330ba4ec7dd88b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_11_16_20_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有傷者自行登上救護車。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d394a37de61ac283495ef439b4107d6/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_11_16_20_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f46c8663746fe7ef9467b0505d891f5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_40_15.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0e09c174e6dcbf7f6773e73f93f0c1c9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_40_14_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大批救援人員在船上。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e5373074dea8e7e1e1f0fd69d534231c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_40_14.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"救援人員在船上處理傷者。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e27b9c5cd94fdec06325fc676673ea0/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_32_23.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05c3aebeba91079308eb8f253d5b14cd/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_32_22_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5aeb213a5d6d25d5b108bd33d853c159/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_32_22.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大批救護車到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ccf12ca0dc4967c6140d660c06304d46/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_58_46.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防出動輔助醫療裝備車。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e29b44ed4ff5c90d0b75771183ec5e43/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_23_31.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e965bd816915b258b13c15bb3560a708/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_18_26.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8842f829a6129f4f24baa49f580390ec/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_18_25_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9b98af8c5ff685214b2c4f01a3e8ac89/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_18_25.jpeg\"/>\n<p>另外，處方指調查人員已會見部分船員以錄取口供，並將繼續會見受傷送院人士（包括船長），以了解事發經過。 處方正根據海事法例，要求該艘渡輪的管理公司於事發後24小時內提交事故報告和相關資料，以便處方審視船舶安全管理程序。<br/> <br/>海事處會繼續積極調查事故，並就事故與內地相關海事單位保持緊密溝通。如發現有任何違反海事法例的行為，定會採取適當的執法行動。</p>\n<p>涉事客輪為 「新迅隆貳號」，是深圳招商迅隆營運的高速雙體客輪，主要行走香港上環港澳碼頭至深圳蛇口郵輪中心航線。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T13:03:54.942661+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":370,"images":18,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T12:43:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T14:43:56.922439+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:57:25.627593+00:00","content_hash":"a327dea5e73cde5c88a589d6e0b85b62140d54948fde96bf7399168d398ac84d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}